Package: macroecohelpers
Type: Package
Title: Helpers for Macroecology and Trait-Evolution Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jacob", "Idec", email = "jacob.idec@ufl.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reusable helpers for macroecology and trait-evolution analysis:
    binding climate, spatial, temporal, and taxonomic covariates to occurrence
    data frames, matching data to phylogenies, and fitting and plotting the
    models that follow.
